OL,3,ANigeria cautions against travel via
OL,4,AEthiopia's main airport due to altitude
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigeria's government has cautioned its
OL,7,Fcitizens, in particular those with
OL,8,Fmedical conditions, against travelling
OL,9,Fvia Ethiopia's main airport due to its
OL,10,Faltitude.
OL,12,FThe foreign ministry in Abuja said 16
OL,13,FNigerians with underlying health
OL,14,Fproblems had died this year while
OL,15,Ftransiting through Addis Ababa.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
