OL,3,ANigeria cautions against travel via
OL,4,AEthiopia's main airport due to altitude
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe city sits at an altitude of 2,334m
OL,7,F(7,657ft) above sea level, making it
OL,8,Fone of the highest capitals in the
OL,9,Fworld. Bole International Airport is a
OL,10,Fmajor hub for travel between Africa,
OL,11,Fthe Middle East and Asia, serving
OL,12,Fmillions of passengers a year.
OL,14,FNigeria said those with cardiovascular
OL,15,Fand respiratory conditions were at an
OL,16,Fincreased risk.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
